OL,3,GNEWSAAirport bosses welcome
OL,4,Aconsultation responses
OL,5,
OL,6,FWell over 1,000 people have so far
OL,7,Fshared their views on proposed changes
OL,8,Fto the airspace around Doncaster
OL,9,FSheffield Airport (DSA), the company
OL,10,Fbehind its planned reopening has
OL,11,Frevealed.
OL,13,FTop officials at Fly Doncaster Ltd are
OL,14,Fsaid to be "very pleased" at the high
OL,15,Fengagement with an ongoing consultation
OL,16,Finto the plans.
OL,18,FThe firm is seeking to have controlled
OL,19,Fairspace re-instated at DSA, as well as
OL,20,Fthe introduction of new arrival and
OL,21,Fdeparture routes for passenger flights
OL,22,Fand cargo.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
