OL,3,GNEWSAAirport bosses welcome
OL,4,Aconsultation responses
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristian Foster, director of the city
OL,7,Fcouncil-owned company which would
OL,8,Foperate DSA, said the views would help
OL,9,Fto refine the plans, adding it was "a
OL,10,Fgenuine chance for stakeholders and the
OL,11,Fpublic to have their say".
